    "one; if they drift, the editor lies about what the render will do and nothing fails",
    "loudly. Neither implementation can be 'fixed' alone while this file is the oracle.",
    "",
    "`expect` lists [prompt_a, prompt_b, w, seed] per frame; w is compared to 6dp."
