  "lyric_comment": [
    "Lyric-derived cuts (Dream's 'follow the lyrics'). Lines are SONG-ABSOLUTE; every",
    "other time on the card is composition-LOCAL, so `segStart` is subtracted here and",
    "nowhere else. `expect` lists [frame, isGapStart]."
  ],
